lass="absolute top-1/2 right-0 -translate-y-1/2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" data-testid="keyboard_arrow_down" class="origin-center transition duration-150 rotate-180"><path fill="currentColor" d="m12 15.4l-6-6L7.4 8l4.6 4.6L16.6 8L18 9.4z"></path></svg></div></button><section id="accordion-panel-0" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-expand-0" class="m-accordion__body transition-height overflow-hidden duration-150"><div class="pb-md text-sm wrap-break-word"><div class="flex flex-col gap-md"><div class="grid-cols-auto-fill gap-x-xs gap-y-md grid lg:grid-cols-3"><img width="150" height="150" data-nuxt-img="" class="border-color-default aspect-square w-full cursor-pointer border object-cover" alt="" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" src="https://mdpi-res.com/applsci/applsci-10-05660/article_deploy/html/images/applsci-10-05660-ag-550.jpg?1597735815"><img width="150" height="150" data-nuxt-img="" class="border-color-default aspect-square w-full cursor-pointer border object-cover" alt="The Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses (PRISMA) flow diagram." loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" src="https://mdpi-res.com/applsci/applsci-10-05660/article_deploy/html/images/applsci-10-05660-g001-550.jpg?1597735813"></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class="m-accordion mx-auto flex w-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-white lg:hidden" data-testid="article-figures-section"><div class="m-accordion__item border-color-default border-b [&amp;&gt;button]:mb-0"><button id="accordion-button-expand-0" aria-controls="accordion-panel-0" class="mb-xs py-md relative flex w-full cursor-pointer text-sm outline-offset-2" aria-expanded="false"><div><span class="m-text text-base font-semibold">Article Figures (2)</span></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 right-0 -translate-y-1/2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" data-testid="keyboard_arrow_down" class="origin-center transition duration-150"><path fill="currentColor" d="m12 15.4l-