-reference" aria-label="Reference 48" reference-link="#B48-applsci-10-05660">48</span>]</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" class="html-align-center">Enhances knowledge retention and<br>spatial abilities</td><td align="center" valign="middle" class="html-align-center">[<span tabindex="0" role="link" class="html-reference" aria-label="Reference 49" reference-link="#B49-applsci-10-05660">49</span>,<span tabindex="0" role="link" class="html-reference" aria-label="Reference 50" reference-link="#B50-applsci-10-05660">50</span>]</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" class="html-align-center">Supports creative learning</td><td align="center" valign="middle" class="html-align-center">[<span tabindex="0" role="link" class="html-reference" aria-label="Reference 51" reference-link="#B51-applsci-10-05660">51</span>]</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" class="html-align-center">Increases interactivity and<br>information accessibility</td><td align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" class="html-align-center">[<span tabindex="0" role="link" class="html-reference" aria-label="Reference 51" reference-link="#B51-applsci-10-05660">51</span>,<span tabindex="0" role="link" class="html-reference" aria-label="Reference 52" reference-link="#B52-applsci-10-05660">52</span>]</td></tr></tbody>
